{"asset_key":"ep2/gameplay_story_12600020","episode":"ep2","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"12600020","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:4:1260002001:1":{"text":"即使被拉开，血薇帮与水鬼帮的帮派成员还在彼此怒目而视，互相叫骂……","source_cn":"即使被拉开，血薇帮与水鬼帮的帮派成员还在彼此怒目而视，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA34684FBF26C83B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1260002002:1":{"text":"别拦着我，我要给这帮粉毛鹦鹉一点颜色看看！","source_cn":"别拦着我，我要给这帮粉毛鹦鹉一点颜色看看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F21E7A3CF735120","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1260002003:1":{"text":"行了，人家血薇帮的老大都来了，给他们点面子吧——","source_cn":"行了，人家血薇帮的老大都来了，给他们点面子吧——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6E8EF2ADAFC42F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1260002004:1":{"text":"什么？！老子用得到你们给面子？！","source_cn":"什么？！老子用得到你们给面子？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BEAA60452918724","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1260002005:1":{"text":"眼看着争执又有升级的势头，一个有力的声音响了起来。","source_cn":"眼看着争执又有升级的势头，一个有力的声音响了起来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4CB16CDA9514681","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1260002006:1":{"text":"都别吵了！","source_cn":"都别吵了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9743181AF4FA939E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1260002007:1":{"text":"……当、当家的！这么点小事，您怎么亲自来了……","source_cn":"……当、当家的！这么点小事，您怎么亲自来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB977909B2A0ECD38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1260002008:1":{"text":"哼，没人撑腰连站都站不直的蠢货，血薇帮的人就是孬种。","source_cn":"哼，没人撑腰连站都站不直的蠢货，血薇帮的人就是孬种。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE2A1AA7555DEE01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1260002009:1":{"text":"你——！！！","source_cn":"你——！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABA3F2CD25C2A4F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1260002010:1":{"text":"——都给我住口！站好！","source_cn":"——都给我住口！站好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FB5981EC028783A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1260002011:1":{"text":"又是你们。巡查完成了吗，这是本周第几次当街闹事了？","source_cn":"又是你们。巡查完成了吗，这是本周第几次当街闹事了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F42B29385C209D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1260002012:1":{"text":"不是，大当家！这次是这帮水鬼帮的人无理取闹——","source_cn":"不是，大当家！这次是这帮水鬼帮的人无理取闹——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE64338D70428F11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1260002013:1":{"text":"无理取闹？我知道前因后果。","source_cn":"无理取闹？我知道前因后果。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48FD34C6D118BDCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1260002014:1":{"text":"达里洛，不管是不是故意的，道歉。我们血薇帮有自己的规则，别让外人看笑话。","source_cn":"达里洛，不管是不是故意的，道歉。我们血薇帮有自己的规则...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2117E795620F38D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1260002015:1":{"text":"……我……","source_cn":"……我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E593881D7CC017C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1260002016:1":{"text":"成吧……抱歉了，舒帕。","source_cn":"成吧……抱歉了，舒帕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F0EFAFAFE82E362","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1260002017:1":{"text":"舒帕，这次水鬼帮占理，我不追究你那些发言。","source_cn":"舒帕，这次水鬼帮占理，我不追究你那些发言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2631D3382F978D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1260002018:1":{"text":"但记住，谨言慎行。我允许没和死潮舰队作恶的水鬼帮在城里讨生活，但不代表我的宽容毫无底线。","source_cn":"但记住，谨言慎行。我允许没和死潮舰队作恶的水鬼帮在城里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D61B59C67EDAE81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1260002019:1":{"text":"和你们勾结过的泰西欧在和绞刑架为伴，你们引以为鉴！","source_cn":"和你们勾结过的泰西欧在和绞刑架为伴，你们引以为鉴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02F86AB56AB7C481","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1260002020:1":{"text":"知、知道了……","source_cn":"知、知道了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D98C641854472B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1260002021:1":{"text":"仅此一次，下不为例。","source_cn":"仅此一次，下不为例。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68C16BE09F632A52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1260002022:1":{"text":"谁要是敢再犯，我就把他拖去港口，直接沉到海底下。","source_cn":"谁要是敢再犯，我就把他拖去港口，直接沉到海底下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"