是。码头上哪有不打架的，但最近事态有点控制不住。","source_cn":"是。码头上哪有不打架的，但最近事态有点控制不住。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7763F181A1C1819B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1260002027:1":{"text":"水鬼帮本来就阳奉阴违，血薇帮的人在索尼娅和我的强压下，也有怨气。","source_cn":"水鬼帮本来就阳奉阴违，血薇帮的人在索尼娅和我的强压下，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20592324D6050FEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1260002028:1":{"text":"所以，我们来找你出主意。","source_cn":"所以，我们来找你出主意。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF891926148356612","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"所以，我们来找你出主意。","female":"所以，我们来找你出主意。","variant_male_record_index":"140141","variant_female_record_index":"140142","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1260002029:1":{"text":"要我说，你就干脆让他们打去。只要不闹出人命来，打着打着气就消了。","source_cn":"要我说，你就干脆让他们打去。只要不闹出人命来，打着打着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B6D6E6B9622C7D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1260002030:1":{"text":"……辛巴达？你怎么也在。","source_cn":"……辛巴达？你怎么也在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4A3A57F6DD81C53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1260002031:1":{"text":"我一直都在！从卢卡找过来时就在了！","source_cn":"我一直都在！从卢卡找过来时就在了